    "Dayi 窗口在最前面。请切回目标应用并把光标放进输入框，再按 ⌃⌥P。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dayi 窗口在最前面。请切回目标应用并把光标放进输入框，再按 ⌃⌥P。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dayi is in front. Return to the target app, focus the input, then press ⌃⌥P."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "POLISH_ENDPOINT 必须为不含凭据或查询参数的 HTTPS URL": {
