    "在任何应用的输入区选中文字，按下快捷键。\n达意会就地改写，并保留一次专用撤回。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何应用的输入区选中文字，按下快捷键。\n达意会就地改写，并保留一次专用撤回。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select text in any app’s input field and press the shortcut.\nDayi rewrites it in place and keeps a dedicated undo."
          }
        }
      }
